=== Formatting ===
2 + 3 = 5
literal only
{} is an empty pair, not an argument
a set is written {a, b} and has 2 elements
int   = 42
neg   = -7
float = 2.5
bool  = true false
char  = A
array = { 1, 2, 3 }
grid  = { { 1, 2 }, { 3, 4 } }
points = { .{ .x = 0, .y = 1 }, .{ .x = 2, .y = 3 } }
ref nil = null
name count ratio
alpha 3 0.25
